Package: infiltrator-os
Version: @VERSION@
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Infiltrator Projects <noreply@infiltrator-projects.invalid>
Depends: infiltrator-os-plymouth-theme (= @VERSION@), infiltratorfs, infiltrator-filesystem-support, infiltrator-software, infiltrator-system-settings, infiltrator-calendar, infiltrator-system-monitor, infiltrator-defragmenter, infiltrator-calculator
Description: Infiltrator OS desktop component bundle
 Installs the released Infiltrator desktop, storage and system applications
 together with the Plymouth boot theme. This package does not reformat a disk,
 migrate the root filesystem, or replace the distribution kernel.
